AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::constructor
├── when bonus discount is greater than 0.1 ether
│   └── it should revert
├── when payment token share is greater than 0.1 ether
│   └── it should revert
└── when all parameters are valid
    ├── when setting normal parameter values
    │   ├── it should set bonusDiscount
    │   ├── it should set paymentTokenShare
    │   ├── it should set owner
    │   ├── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
    │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
    ├── when bonus discount is maximum
    │   ├── it should set bonusDiscount
    │   └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
    ├── when payment token share is maximum
    │   ├── it should set paymentTokenShare
    │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
    ├── when bonus discount is zero
    │   ├── it should set bonusDiscount
    │   └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
    └── when payment token share is zero
        ├── it should set paymentTokenShare
        └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
